  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Li̱eŋ Dee-bid kɛ lia̱a̱ Thɔɔl",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr lieth Thɔɔl. Cu Dee-bid luny jɔk juc ji̱ Ä-ma-lek, kä cuɛ te kä Dhik-lag kɛ ni̱n da̱ŋ rɛw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ diɔ̱ɔ̱k ni̱ni, nɛnɛ, cu raan ben wi̱i̱ Thɔɔl kɛ bieyni ti ci rɛ̈t kä ci wi̱cdɛ thia̱a̱ŋ kɛ tuäk. Kä mëë cɛ ben kä Dee-bid cuɛ rɔ goŋ luthä nhiamdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid ɛ thiec i̱, “Kä bi̱i̱ni kä?” Kä cuɛ loc i̱, “Barä rɔ wi̱c ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid ɛ jiök i̱, “Kä ɛŋu mi ci tuɔɔk? Läri jɛ ɣä.” Kä cuɛ jɛ loc i̱, “Ci naath rɔ bar ko̱o̱r, kä ca nɛy ti ŋuan näk. Amäni Thɔɔl kɛnɛ gatdɛ ni Jo-na-than caakɛ näk bä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid ɛ jiök i̱, “Ŋäci jɛ i̱di Thɔɔl kɛnɛ gatdɛ ni Jo-na-than caakɛ näk?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ŋuɛ̈t in lär jɛ ruac ɛ jiök i̱, “Cɛ tuɔɔk cä wä pääm Gil-bwä. Cua̱ Thɔɔl nɛn cɛ rɔ nhiɛt kɛ mutdɛ. Kä ci thurbiɛɛli ji̱ tɛ̈r kɛnɛ jiöŋkööri ku thuŋ cop kä jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min cɛ jɔkdɛ liɛc, cuɛ ɣä nɛn, kä cuɛ ɣä cɔl. Kä cua̱ jɛ loc i̱, ‘Ɣän ɛn.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ɣä thiec i̱, ‘Ɛ ji̱n ŋa?’ Kä cua̱ jɛ loc i̱, ‘Ɛ ɣän raan Ä-ma-lek.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ɣä jiök i̱, ‘Bër wa̱a̱ nɛmɛ kä näk ɣä. Ɣän ta̱a̱ kɛ buɔ̱t mi di̱i̱t, kä cä thia̱k kɛ lia̱a̱.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua̱ ben kuthdɛ, kä cua̱ jɛ näk, kɛ ɣöö cä ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö /cɛ bi tëk min cɛ tɛɛth. Kä cua̱ kum kuäärä ka̱n wi̱i̱dɛ kɛnɛ thiaw in te tetädɛ, kä cua̱kɛ nöŋ kuäärä ɛn wa̱a̱ nɛmɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid bieynikɛ rɛ̈t kɛ pa̱r. Kä cu nɛy diaal tin te kɛɛl kɛ jɛ bieynikiɛn rɛ̈t bä pärkɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ pa̱r kä cukɛ wiee kä /kenkɛ mi̱th amäni thiaŋ, kɛ kui̱ Thɔɔl kɛnɛ gatdɛ ni Jo-na-than, kɛ kui̱ nɛɛni Kuɔth Nhial, kɛ kui̱ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, kɛ ɣöö ca kɛ näk ko̱o̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid ŋuɛ̈t in lär jɛ ruac thiec i̱, “Bi̱i̱ nikä?” Kä cuɛ loc i̱, “Ɛ ɣän raan Ä-ma-lek mi cieŋ rɛy wecdun.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid Ɛ jiök i̱, “Ɛŋu /keni dual ɔ kɛ näk kua̱r mi ca kuany ɛ Kuoth Nhial ɔ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid ŋuɛ̈t kɛl cɔl kä cuɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Wër näk ɛ!” Kä cuɛ jɛ näk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid ɛ jiök i̱, “Ɛ riɛmdu te ni wi̱i̱du, kɛ ɣöö ci rɔ lat ni kärɔa kɛ thokdu, wi̱i̱ i̱, ‘Cä kuäär in ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ kuany näk.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pa̱r Dee-bid kɛ Thɔɔl kɛnɛ Jo-na-than",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid diit pärä ti̱ti̱ lat kɛ kui̱ Thɔɔl kɛnɛ Jo-na-than gatdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wee ba Dit Bäärä nɛmɛ ŋi̱i̱c ni ji̱ Juda. Kä nɛnɛ cua gɔ̱a̱r rɛy buɔk Ya-car. Wee i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
